# Hookpoints: Tokenizer

```yaml
module: "brain/master/src/tokenizer/"
registry_crate: "brain/hooks/src/lib.rs"

hook_ids:
  HOK_TOK_BEFORE_LOAD:
    id:      "hok://brain/tok/before_load"
    trigger: "Before GgufTokenizer::from_gguf(model)"
    ctx:     "{ model_path: &str, vocab_size_hint: usize }"
    e4:      "pass-through"
    e5:      "license check â€” verify model authorized for this actor"

  HOK_TOK_AFTER_LOAD:
    id:      "hok://brain/tok/after_load"
    trigger: "After tokenizer loaded, before first encode()"
    ctx:     "{ vocab_size: usize, model_type: &str, bos_id: Option<u32> }"
    e4:      "pass-through"
    e5:      "telemetry â€” record model fingerprint"

  HOK_TOK_BEFORE_ENCODE:
    id:      "hok://brain/tok/before_encode"
    trigger: "Before encode(text)"
    ctx:     "{ text: &str, soul_id: Option<&str> }"
    e4:      "pass-through"
    e5:      "content filter â€” check text against RC policy before tokenizing"

  HOK_TOK_AFTER_ENCODE:
    id:      "hok://brain/tok/after_encode"
    trigger: "After encode(), before feeding to prefill"
    ctx:     "{ token_count: usize, truncated: bool }"
    e4:      "pass-through"
    e5:      "evidence pack â€” record token_count per session"

  HOK_TOK_BEFORE_DECODE:
    id:      "hok://brain/tok/before_decode"
    trigger: "Before decode(ids)"
    ctx:     "{ ids: &[u32] }"
    e4:      "pass-through"
    e5:      "pass-through (decode is low-risk)"

  HOK_TOK_AFTER_DECODE:
    id:      "hok://brain/tok/after_decode"
    trigger: "After decode() â€” text is ready for output"
    ctx:     "{ text: &str, token_count: usize }"
    e4:      "pass-through"
    e5:      "output audit â€” hallucination filter before Surface"

registration: |
  BrainHookRegistry::e4_defaults() auto-registers all 6 tokenizer hooks
  as PassThroughHook. Wire e5 governance by replacing via registry.register().
```
